  "description": [
    "32 pages : 20 cm",
    "\"Get young bakers making their own treats with Super Simple Healthy Cookies! Kids can follow the super simple recipes in this book to learn how to make nutty oat squares, mouthwatering raspberry swirl cookies and more. With simple text, how-to photos, and tricks and tips, cooking has never been easier or more fun. Aligned to Common Core Standards and correlated to state standards. Super Sandcastle is an imprint of Abdo Publishing, a division of ABDO.\"--",
    "Sweet treats & healthy eats -- Cooking basics -- Measuring ingredients -- You know this = that? -- Cooking terms -- Kitchen utensils -- Super simple ingredients -- Chocolate surprise bites -- Gluten-free sesame cookies -- Sweet molasses cookies -- Nutty oat cookie squares -- Giant breakfast cookies -- Banana cookies bites -- Perfect purple cookies -- Raspberry swirls"
  ],
